'''Arch-Mage Shalidor''' is a legendary [[Online:Nord|Nord]] mage from the [[Lore:First Era|First Era]]. When you are tasked by the [[Online:Mages Guild|Mages Guild]] to [[Online:Long Lost Lore|collect rare books]], he will appear and ask you to collect four rare tomes to take back his sanctuary, [[ON:Eyevea|Eyevea]], from the [[Lore:Shivering Isles|Shivering Isles]].

He was once married to [[Online:Ulfsild the Evergreen|Ulfsild]].
