Once you reach Daggerwaymore to begin the final act, Sheogorath will make facsimiles of Shalidor, Valaste and Vanus Galerion appear in the ruined buildings. You will need to save them from being killed by the Covenant leaders. When you rescue Shalidor he will admit something before disappearing:
:'''Arch-Mage Shalidor:''' ''"I would have given up the island for her. She never gave me the chance to decide …. My wife …."''

